## Why This Is Asked
Tests real-time, multi-tenant isolation, scalable compute, and precise cost accounting under burst, using Azure services.

## Key Concepts
- tenant isolation via Cosmos partitions and network policies
- ingress-budget checks with Redis as fast quota cache
- KEDA autoscaling on AKS for per-tenant workloads
